From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:30:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 089/148] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the sidebar
 rows' waiting state: clear stale dialogs, read own status once, trust the
 open chat

blocked_on is now served only while the session's cached status is running or waiting, and the relinquish, failed-to-idle reset and runner status probe paths clear it, so a row never reads parked on a dialog that is gone. The list builder reads the session's own status and its starting flag once and derives both status and turn_active from them. The open row prefers the chat store's turn and dialog over the list row's, which lag by a websocket tick; unbound rows use the row's fields.
